; THE MARSH ROAD - where the road stops, when it stops.
;
; A wayside event that interrupts a journey drops you into a place like any other. This one is that
; place, and it is a fight, and that is a coincidence rather than a rule: a merchant, a shrine or a
; broken bridge would be the same entry in the same weighted table, resolving to somewhere else
; (PLACES_AND_PERSISTENCE.md section 7).
;
;   .  floor      ~  difficult ground   #  rock      @  the hero starts
;   1-9 a spawn   |  wall up a line     -  wall along a line   x  door, shut   +  a corner

